# Testing and Quality Assurance

## Test Coverage Requirements
Based on [.plan/specs/enhanced-ai-personality/tasks.md](mdc:.plan/specs/enhanced-ai-personality/tasks.md) and implementation at [src/ai/personality/enhanced-personality.ts](mdc:src/ai/personality/enhanced-personality.ts):

### Unit Tests (Tasks 8.1-8.3)
- System instruction framework validation
- Self-reflection processing logic  
- Emotional intelligence and conversation awareness
- Quality evaluation against 4 criteria (authenticity, empathy, coherence, usefulness)

### Integration Tests (Tasks 9.1-9.2)  
- Gemini Live API compatibility with enhancements
- Real-time audio streaming with personality processing
- Performance validation (<300ms enhancement overhead)
- Stress testing for extended conversation sessions

## Quality Metrics
- **Response Authenticity**: >8.5/10 subjective rating
- **Emotional Appropriateness**: >85% accuracy  
- **Conversation Quality**: Natural, engaging, and contextually appropriate
- **Error Resilience**: >95% graceful degradation success

## Testing Patterns
```typescript
describe('EnhancedPersonality', () => {
  it('should maintain response latency under 300ms');
  it('should adapt communication style to user context');
  it('should demonstrate authentic personality traits');
  it('should handle audio processing failures gracefully');
});
```

## Performance Testing
- Memory usage monitoring during extended sessions
- Audio latency measurements with enhancement processing
- 3D visualization frame rate validation
- Concurrent audio source management testing